#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/grid/reykjanes_contour.rst:22
msgid "Reykjanes Isosurface"
msgstr "Reykjanes 等値面"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/grid/reykjanes_contour.rst:24
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates how to render the isosurfaces of a 3D structured "
"grid."
msgstr "この例は，3D構造格子の等値面のレンダリング方法を示します．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/grid/reykjanes_contour.rst:27
msgid "📋 Summary"
msgstr "📋 まとめ"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/grid/reykjanes_contour.rst:29
msgid ""
"The sample data is taken from a Met Office NAME Model time-series simulation"
" of the Icelandic Reykjanes Peninsula eruption on 29 May 2024."
msgstr ""
"サンプルデータは，2024年5月29日のアイスランドReykjanes半島噴火のMet Office "
"NAMEモデル時系列シミュレーションから取得したものです．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/grid/reykjanes_contour.rst:32
msgid ""
"A structured grid of cubic voxels is constructed for the 1D spatial "
"coordinates and then thresholded to reveal the underlying volcanic plume of "
"Sulphur Dioxide Air Concentration."
msgstr ""
"1次元空間座標に対して立方体ボクセルの構造格子が構築され，二酸化硫黄空気濃度の基礎となる火山プルームを明らかにするためにしきい値が設定されます．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/grid/reykjanes_contour.rst:36
msgid ""
"The visualization is enhanced by rendering isosufaces of the plume using a "
"mixture of opacity and smooth shading to yield a semi-transparent cloud-like"
" effect."
msgstr ""
"不透明度とスムーズシェーディングの混合を使用してプルームの等値面をレンダリングすることにより，半透明の雲のような効果を得て可視化が強化されます．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/grid/reykjanes_contour.rst:40
msgid ""
"The cited release location of the eruption on the peninsula is marked, "
"highlighting the volcanic plume's eastward transport and southerly "
"dispersion."
msgstr "半島の噴火の引用された放出位置がマークされ，火山プルームの東方への輸送と南方への分散が強調されています．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/grid/reykjanes_contour.rst:46
msgid "Structured grid projection transformation support is pending."
msgstr "構造格子投影変換サポートは保留中です．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/grid/reykjanes_contour.rst:56
msgid ""
"🏷 Tags: experimental 🧪 component: coastlines component: graticule component:"
" texture domain: volcanology filter: contour filter: threshold load: grid "
"version: 0.6.0"
msgstr ""
"🏷 Tags: experimental 🧪 component: coastlines component: graticule component:"
